{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778140/extras/logo_small.png?t=1761200834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome, new exorcists, to <i>Tales of Yokai Harmony</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo version, you can experience the main gameplay mode, <i>Expedition</i>, where Sokoban-style puzzles meet visual novel storytelling.<br>Team up with yokai of the Five Elements, restore the balance of Yin and Yang, and explore the mystical world ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Available in Demo&gt;</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Opening</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expedition: Chapter 0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expedition: Chapter 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Coming Soon&gt;</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond Garden (Gifting system)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation: Heart-Pounding Exorcism! (Guidebook)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outings (Go on dates with yokai)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flower Archive (Replay scenes and memories)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ver. 0.5.0</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778140?t=1761200834","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778140?t=1761200834","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778140/02e5857eea7b9ba7428833803d7e333931eaf1e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761200834","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778140/02e5857eea7b9ba7428833803d7e333931eaf1e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761200834","categor